{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱいすぎるので一つ一つ振り返っていきましょう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・舞台「じょしらく」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂としてはプリンシパル以外のこういう舞台は初めてということで\n公開オーディションも想像してたより緊張してしまい思うように力を出しきれなかったのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「空琉美遊亭 丸京」⬅︎くうるびゅうてぃ がんきょう  という役にキャスティングしていただきましたっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名前の通りガンちゃんは、普段はクールなメガネっ子。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はトリプルキャストなので\n原作のイメージを壊さない程度に私だけの色をつけていけたらなと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じ役の未央奈も琴子もなかなか強い個性を出してきそうなので、あみも負けないように頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・台湾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう知ってる方がほとんどだとは思いますが 乃木團でまさかの海外進出！\n台湾に行ってました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"台湾では、乃木團としてライブをやらさていただいたり盛りだくさん(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ天は台湾密着スペシャルと、あとはいろんなロケをたくさんやってきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ詳しいことは言えないんだけど\n楽しみにしてて欲しい(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/04/06/6275918/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/04/06/6275918/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/04/06/6275918/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/04/06/6275918/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ写真いーっぱい撮ったけどそれは今度まとめてのっけちゃいます(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":".........台湾最高。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・アルバム個別握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"台湾から帰ってすぐにアルバムの個別握手会がありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみが選んだ衣装は、ガールズルール！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/04/06/6275918/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緑のレタスちゃん色だよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お気に入りなの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アルバム握手会の時ってこうやって衣装着るけど意外となんの衣装かわからないって言われちゃうこと多いんだけど、\n今回はさすがにみんなわかったね(*^^*)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてこの日はせいたんの乃木坂46のメンバーとしての活動最後の日でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたんへのメッセージは最後に書きます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・京都個別握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の服は、あみあみ族ならすぐわかったはず！\n11枚目個人PVの「zoo＆jou」で着てたルームウェア！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろんずーとお揃いできたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/04/06/6275918/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/04/06/6275918/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/04/06/6275918/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モコモコ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/04/06/6275918/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/04/06/6275918/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずー嫌がってるけど気にしない！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/04/06/6275918/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたんへ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたん卒業おめでとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直寂しくて寂しくてたまらないです\nでも卒業セレモニーのときせいたんの背中を見て、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁ大丈夫だなって思えました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちっちゃいけど、大きな背中に見えました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただノギビンゴで、ずーとせいたんとあみのヤンキー3人集が出来なくなるのが寂しいよお。。（；＿；）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれはせいたんがいないとダメなんだよお（；＿；）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーの卒業って、やっぱり辛いです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑顔で見送ってあげなきゃってわかってるけど、涙が止まらなくなってしまう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業してもお願いだからご飯とか誘ってもいい？\nまたハロウィンパーティーしようね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっとずっと大好きだよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/04/06/6275918/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/04/06/6275918/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/04/06/6275918/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/04/06/6275918/0014.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}